{"id":"fc728ef2e25025aa","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-ep-bilimit.md","title":"可数 EP 链的逐点极限","display":"thm-ep-bilimit — 可数 EP 链的逐点极限","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-ep-bilimit","aliases":["16-thm-ep-bilimit","16-thm--ep-bilimit"],"display":"thm-ep-bilimit — 可数 EP 链的逐点极限","depends_on":["[[16-df-cpo]]","[[16-df-embedding-projection]]","[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]"],"source":"Local EP-chain proof; background §10.6 p. 638 (PDF 658), D-infinity mentioned §2.5.3(ii) p. 156 (PDF 176)","revision_date":"2026-10-15","verification_status":"proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-ep-bilimit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-ep-bilimit</span><span>16-thm--ep-bilimit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ep-bilimit — 可数 EP 链的逐点极限"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" href=\"?note=ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" title=\"16-df-embedding-projection\">16-df-embedding-projection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a101152a4f31cd83\" href=\"?note=a101152a4f31cd83\" title=\"16-df-dcpo-function-space\">16-df-dcpo-function-space</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Local EP-chain proof; background §10.6 p. 638 (PDF 658), D-infinity mentioned §2.5.3(ii) p. 156 (PDF 176)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(D_n,e_n,p_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((D_n,e_n,p_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为小 dcpo 的链，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EP}_{D_n,D_{n+1}}(e_n,p_n)\">\\(\\mathrm{EP}_{D_n,D_{n+1}}(e_n,p_n)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" href=\"?note=ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" title=\"16-df-embedding-projection\">16-df-embedding-projection</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\leq j\">\\(i\\leq j\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{i,j}=e_{j-1}\\circ\\cdots\\circ e_i\">\\(e_{i,j}=e_{j-1}\\circ\\cdots\\circ e_i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{i,j}=p_i\\circ\\cdots\\circ p_{j-1}\">\\(p_{i,j}=p_i\\circ\\cdots\\circ p_{j-1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{i,i}=p_{i,i}=\\operatorname{id}_{D_i}\">\\(e_{i,i}=p_{i,i}=\\operatorname{id}_{D_i}\\)</span>。下文空复合取恒等。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\infty\">\\(D_\\infty\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_n\">\\(\\pi_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_n\">\\(\\iota_n\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_n\">\\(a_n\\)</span> 由下文构造；有向上确界采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EP},\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{DCPO},\\mathrm{Directed}\">\\(\\mathrm{EP},\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{DCPO},\\mathrm{Directed}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" href=\"?note=ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" title=\"16-df-embedding-projection\">16-df-embedding-projection</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a> 的带偏序参数含义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nD_\\infty&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\prod_{n\\in\\mathbb N}D_n\\mid(\\forall n)\\ p_n(x_{n+1})=x_n\\},\\\\\nx\\leq_\\infty y&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall n)\\ x_n\\leq_{D_n}y_n,\\qquad\n\\pi_n(x)\\coloneqq x_n,\\\\\n(\\iota_n(d))_k&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}p_{k,n}(d)&amp;k\\leq n,\\\\e_{n,k}(d)&amp;n&lt;k,\\end{cases}\\qquad\na_n\\coloneqq\\iota_n\\circ\\pi_n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nD_\\infty&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\prod_{n\\in\\mathbb N}D_n\\mid(\\forall n)\\ p_n(x_{n+1})=x_n\\},\\\\\nx\\leq_\\infty y&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall n)\\ x_n\\leq_{D_n}y_n,\\qquad\n\\pi_n(x)\\coloneqq x_n,\\\\\n(\\iota_n(d))_k&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}p_{k,n}(d)&amp;k\\leq n,\\\\e_{n,k}(d)&amp;n&lt;k,\\end{cases}\\qquad\na_n\\coloneqq\\iota_n\\circ\\pi_n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D_\\infty,\\leq_\\infty),\\\\\n(\\forall S\\subseteq D_\\infty)\\left(\\mathrm{Directed}_{D_\\infty}(S)\\Longrightarrow\n(\\forall n)\\ (\\bigsqcup_\\infty S)_n=\\bigsqcup_{D_n}\\{x_n\\mid x\\in S\\}\\right),\\\\\n(\\forall n)\\ \\mathrm{EP}_{D_n,D_\\infty}(\\iota_n,\\pi_n),\\qquad\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)\\ a_n\\leq a_{n+1}\\leq\\operatorname{id}_{D_\\infty},\\qquad\n\\bigsqcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}a_n=\\operatorname{id}_{D_\\infty},\\\\\n(\\forall n)\\mathrm{CPO}(D_n,\\leq_{D_n})\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{CPO}(D_\\infty,\\leq_\\infty)\\land\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)\\ (\\bot_\\infty)_n=\\bot_{D_n}\\right).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D_\\infty,\\leq_\\infty),\\\\\n(\\forall S\\subseteq D_\\infty)\\left(\\mathrm{Directed}_{D_\\infty}(S)\\Longrightarrow\n(\\forall n)\\ (\\bigsqcup_\\infty S)_n=\\bigsqcup_{D_n}\\{x_n\\mid x\\in S\\}\\right),\\\\\n(\\forall n)\\ \\mathrm{EP}_{D_n,D_\\infty}(\\iota_n,\\pi_n),\\qquad\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)\\ a_n\\leq a_{n+1}\\leq\\operatorname{id}_{D_\\infty},\\qquad\n\\bigsqcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}a_n=\\operatorname{id}_{D_\\infty},\\\\\n(\\forall n)\\mathrm{CPO}(D_n,\\leq_{D_n})\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{CPO}(D_\\infty,\\leq_\\infty)\\land\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)\\ (\\bot_\\infty)_n=\\bot_{D_n}\\right).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：连续性使逐点上确界保持方程 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_nx_{n+1}=x_n\">\\(p_nx_{n+1}=x_n\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_n\">\\(\\iota_n\\)</span> 的相邻分量相容；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_n\\iota_n=\\operatorname{id}\">\\(\\pi_n\\iota_n=\\operatorname{id}\\)</span>，而在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&gt;n\">\\(k&gt;n\\)</span> 的分量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{n,k}p_{n,k}\\leq\\operatorname{id}\">\\(e_{n,k}p_{n,k}\\leq\\operatorname{id}\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_n\\leq\\operatorname{id}\">\\(a_n\\leq\\operatorname{id}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_n\">\\(a_n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{n+1}\">\\(a_{n+1}\\)</span> 比较只需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_np_n\\leq\\operatorname{id}\">\\(e_np_n\\leq\\operatorname{id}\\)</span>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 后，所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq k\">\\(n\\geq k\\)</span> 都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a_nx)_k=x_k\">\\((a_nx)_k=x_k\\)</span>，故逐点上确界是恒等。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_n,\\iota_n\">\\(\\pi_n,\\iota_n\\)</span> 连续由各分量连续推出。若各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n\">\\(D_n\\)</span> 有底，则 EP 投影保持底：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_n(\\bot)\\leq p_ne_n(\\bot)=\\bot\">\\(p_n(\\bot)\\leq p_ne_n(\\bot)=\\bot\\)</span>；所以底序列相容。</p>\n<p>这是为原有极限节点补写的本地推导；原书 §2.5.3(ii), p. 156 (PDF 176) 只提及 Scott 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\infty\">\\(D_\\infty\\)</span> 并转引文献，没有在该处给出本定理的完整构造。EP 背景见 §10.6, p. 638 (PDF 658)。本页不把本地推导冒充原书编号定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d561a55729f9cdb8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cpo]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-embedding-projection","status":"resolved","id":"ef7dfd09239bb0b1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-embedding-projection]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dcpo-function-space","status":"resolved","id":"a101152a4f31cd83","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-embedding-projection","status":"resolved","id":"ef7dfd09239bb0b1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(D_n,e_n,p_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$ 为小 dcpo 的链，$\\mathrm{EP}_{D_n,D_{n+1}}(e_n,p_n)$ 见 [[16-df-embedding-projection]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d561a55729f9cdb8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D_\\infty$、$\\pi_n$、$\\iota_n$ 和 $a_n$ 由下文构造；有向上确界采用 [[16-df-cpo]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-embedding-projection","status":"resolved","id":"ef7dfd09239bb0b1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EP},\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{DCPO},\\mathrm{Directed}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-embedding-projection]]、[[16-df-cpo]] 的带偏序参数含义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d561a55729f9cdb8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EP},\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{DCPO},\\mathrm{Directed}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-embedding-projection]]、[[16-df-cpo]] 的带偏序参数含义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(D_n,e_n,p_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EP}_{D_n,D_{n+1}}(e_n,p_n)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\leq j","display":false},{"tex":"e_{i,j}=e_{j-1}\\circ\\cdots\\circ e_i","display":false},{"tex":"p_{i,j}=p_i\\circ\\cdots\\circ p_{j-1}","display":false},{"tex":"e_{i,i}=p_{i,i}=\\operatorname{id}_{D_i}","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_n","display":false},{"tex":"a_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EP},\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{DCPO},\\mathrm{Directed}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nD_\\infty&\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\prod_{n\\in\\mathbb N}D_n\\mid(\\forall n)\\ p_n(x_{n+1})=x_n\\},\\\\\nx\\leq_\\infty y&\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall n)\\ x_n\\leq_{D_n}y_n,\\qquad\n\\pi_n(x)\\coloneqq x_n,\\\\\n(\\iota_n(d))_k&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}p_{k,n}(d)&k\\leq n,\\\\e_{n,k}(d)&n<k,\\end{cases}\\qquad\na_n\\coloneqq\\iota_n\\circ\\pi_n.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D_\\infty,\\leq_\\infty),\\\\\n(\\forall S\\subseteq D_\\infty)\\left(\\mathrm{Directed}_{D_\\infty}(S)\\Longrightarrow\n(\\forall n)\\ (\\bigsqcup_\\infty S)_n=\\bigsqcup_{D_n}\\{x_n\\mid x\\in S\\}\\right),\\\\\n(\\forall n)\\ \\mathrm{EP}_{D_n,D_\\infty}(\\iota_n,\\pi_n),\\qquad\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)\\ a_n\\leq a_{n+1}\\leq\\operatorname{id}_{D_\\infty},\\qquad\n\\bigsqcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}a_n=\\operatorname{id}_{D_\\infty},\\\\\n(\\forall n)\\mathrm{CPO}(D_n,\\leq_{D_n})\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{CPO}(D_\\infty,\\leq_\\infty)\\land\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)\\ (\\bot_\\infty)_n=\\bot_{D_n}\\right).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"p_nx_{n+1}=x_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_n\\iota_n=\\operatorname{id}","display":false},{"tex":"k>n","display":false},{"tex":"e_{n,k}p_{n,k}\\leq\\operatorname{id}","display":false},{"tex":"a_n\\leq\\operatorname{id}","display":false},{"tex":"a_n","display":false},{"tex":"a_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"e_np_n\\leq\\operatorname{id}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq k","display":false},{"tex":"(a_nx)_k=x_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_n,\\iota_n","display":false},{"tex":"D_n","display":false},{"tex":"p_n(\\bot)\\leq p_ne_n(\\bot)=\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\infty","display":false}],"bytes":2933,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-cpo]]、[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]、[[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]、[[16-df-embedding-projection]]、[[16-thm-ep-properties]]、[[16-thm-ep-bilimit]]、[[16-thm-inverse-limit]]、[[16-df-lambda-category]]、[[16-thm-domain-model]]。极限构造的完整证明是明示的本地补写；λ-category 按 §2.5 的指定反身对象接口定义。"},{"id":"6cb45d716150df5b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D_\\infty,\\pi_n,\\iota_n,a_n$ 由 [[16-thm-ep-bilimit]] 的显式构造给出；$\\beta(f)$ 的坐标覆盖 $0$ 与所有 $n+1$。"}],"outgoing":["d561a55729f9cdb8","ef7dfd09239bb0b1","a101152a4f31cd83"]}